WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.600
Come into Crow with both knees on the upper arms.

2
00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:03.200
Shift a little more weight forward and engage the belly.

3
00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:04.800
Slowly extend the right leg straight back behind you.

4
00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:06.400
Keep the left knee hooked and the gaze slightly forward.

5
00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:08.000
Hold, then return to Crow and switch sides.
